   "html_text": "The standard realist arguments for the existence of other minds rely on observable physical actions (bodily and verbal). These actions are appealed to as the basis for an analogical argument. Since I perceive that my physical actions depend on my mental volitions, I reason analogically that physical actions not caused by me are willed by some other minds. One might also resort to an inference to the best explanation to argue for the existence of other minds: the supposition of other minds amount",
